  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Food and Nutrition Security Impact, Resilience, Sustainability and Transformation (FIRST)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The objective is to strengthen the enabling environment for food and nutrition security and sustainable agriculture in 20 to 30 priority countries by the provision of policy assistance through FAO and the collaboration of EU Delegations. The focus will be on sectoral and cross-sectoral framework human and organizational capacities and coordination for Food and Nutrition Security and Sustainable Agriculture.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
